"4aabbe12df4d3c2905fca263a94a19a151a234d0e9b0d9ba51535c42f58475a1"} {"question" "q-50373" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "122de489a2fb17360002e9d6afdd30f518ad7c477b5db46c5a5d447bad6fc548"} {"question" "q-50373" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aabbe12df4d3c2905fca263a94a19a151a234d0e9b0d9ba51535c42f58475a1"} {"question" "q-50373" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}-1},\\,8{e}^{t}⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{2t}{{t}^{2}-1},\\,0⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{2t}{{t}^{2}-1},\\,8{e}^{t}⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{2t}{{t}^{2}-1},\\,{e}^{t}⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{2}{{t}^{2}-1},\\,0⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aabbe12df4d3c2905fca263a94a19a151a234d0e9b0d9ba51535c42f58475a1"} {"question" "q-50373" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\frac{2t}{{t}^{2}-1},\\,8{e}^{t}⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aabbe12df4d3c2905fca263a94a19a151a234d0e9b0d9ba51535c42f58475a1"} {"question" "q-34724" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the derivative of  $f(t)={e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,i+{e}^{t}\\,j+{e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,k$ at $t=\\pi .$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aabbe12df4d3c2905fca263a94a19a151a234d0e9b0d9ba51535c42f58475a1"} {"question" "q-34724" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we find ${f}^{′}(t)$ by differentiating each component:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{t})\\,j+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)\\,k \\\\  & =({e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)\\,i+{e}^{t}\\,j+({e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-{e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute ${f}^{′}(\\pi )$ we substitute $t=\\pi $ into the expression for ${f}^{′}(t)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(\\pi ) & =({e}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\pi +{e}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi )\\,i+{e}^{\\pi }\\,j+({e}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi -{e}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\pi )\\,k \\\\  & =({e}^{\\pi }\\cdot 0+{e}^{\\pi }\\cdot (-1))\\,i+{e}^{\\pi }\\,j+({e}^{\\pi }\\cdot (-1)-{e}^{\\pi }\\cdot 0)\\,k \\\\  & =-{e}^{\\pi }\\,i+{e}^{\\pi }\\,j-{e}^{\\pi }\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aabbe12df4d3c2905fca263a94a19a151a234d0e9b0d9ba51535c42f58475a1"} {"question" "q-34724" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "122de489a2fb17360002e9d6afdd30f518ad7c477b5db46c5a5d447bad6fc548"} {"question" "q-34724" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aabbe12df4d3c2905fca263a94a19a151a234d0e9b0d9ba51535c42f58475a1"} {"question" "q-34724" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2{e}^{\\pi }\\,i+{e}^{\\pi }\\,j-2{e}^{\\pi }\\,k"] ["math" "-{e}^{\\pi }\\,i+{e}^{\\pi }\\,j-{e}^{\\pi }\\,k"] ["math" "-{e}^{\\pi }\\,i-{e}^{\\pi }\\,k"] ["math" "{e}^{\\pi }\\,i-{e}^{\\pi }\\,j+{e}^{\\pi }\\,k"] ["math" "{e}^{\\pi }\\,j"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aabbe12df4d3c2905fca263a94a19a151a234d0e9b0d9ba51535c42f58475a1"} {"question" "q-34724" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-{e}^{\\pi }\\,i+{e}^{\\pi }\\,j-{e}^{\\pi }\\,k"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aabbe12df4d3c2905fca263a94a19a151a234d0e9b0d9ba51535c42f58475a1"} {"question" "q-130405" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the derivative of  $f(t)=t{e}^{t}\\,i-3{t}^{2}\\,j+\\frac{3}{{t}^{2}}\\,k$ at $t=2.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aabbe12df4d3c2905fca263a94a19a151a234d0e9b0d9ba51535c42f58475a1"} {"question" "q-130405" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we find ${f}^{′}(t)$ by differentiating each component:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t{e}^{t})\\,i-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3{t}^{2})\\,j+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{3}{{t}^{2}})k \\\\  & =(t+1){e}^{t}\\,i-6t\\,j-\\frac{6}{{t}^{3}}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, to compute ${f}^{′}(2)$ we substitute $t=2$ into the expression for ${f}^{′}(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(2) & =(2+1){e}^{2}\\,i-6(2)\\,j-\\frac{6}{{2}^{3}}\\,k \\\\  & =3{e}^{2}\\,i-12\\,j-\\frac{3}{4}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037297/state.json" "file_sha256" "4aabbe12df4d3c